WEBVTT

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.770
<b>This Is the Tale
of a Little Sister
Who Loves Brother
Too Much to Cope</b>

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.770
<b>Anime
Scheduled!!</b>

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.650
Nagamin's incredible.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.870
Wow, it got another printing?

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.070
You sound awfully indifferent.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.350
It's your title. Aren't you happy?

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:25.670
<i>I am happy. It just doesn't feel real.</i>

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:30.170
You need to realize that 
you're a best-selling author.

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:35.780
By the way, I keep hearing this scrubbing 
sound, but what are you doing?

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:37.640
<i>Hmm? Washing my body off.</i>

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:41.900
I'm scrubbing my cleavage right now.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:45.310
<i>Wh-Why are you washing yourself 
while on the phone?</i>

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:47.440
It's more efficient, isn't it?

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:50.300
I lose if say something about that, don't I?

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.440
<i>There shouldn't be anything to say about it.</i>

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.650
<i>Changing the subject,</i>

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:58.410
<i>I just need to go to the editing office 
to meet the director, right?</i>

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:02.120
Yeah, sorry to force you out here, 
but please meet us there.

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:05.610
Oh, you can bring your little 
sister with you, as well.

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:09.730
I know you're infatuated with little sisters,

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.420
so you can't bear even a 
moment away from them—

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Goodbye!</i>

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:15.360
An anime adaptation, huh?

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:19.720
And the director's Sakurada Itsuki, 
who's released a bunch of hit shows.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:21.900
I need to do my best too.

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:27.540
Minazuki-san? What's going on?

00:01:28.490 --> 00:01:29.430
<i>Hello?</i>

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:31.080
Ah, Onii-chan!

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:32.970
Oh, not today.

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:35.550
Sensei, congratulations 
on the anime adaption!

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:38.450
I promise I'll win the role of your heroine!

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:41.590
Thank you for taking the time to call me.

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:42.540
<i>It's nothing.</i>

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:46.340
Um, was there something else?

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:49.040
<i>Actually, I'm outside your house.</i>

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:49.460
What?!

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:56.240
Why the sudden visit?!

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:59.350
Sensei, please make me 
your real little sister!

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:00.290
Huh?!

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:01.550
Please!

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:38.850
Episode 8: About The Time I Got a New Little Sister

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:39.450
So this is your room, Sensei!

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:41.970
Sit in that chair over there.

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:42.490
Huh?

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:44.210
Okay!

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:49.760
By the way, where's Suzuka-chan?

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:50.620
Huh?

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.750
Oh, I think she's probably in the bath.

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:00.380
Huh?

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:02.580
I'm sorry about that, then.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:04.340
Why are you apologizing?

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:09.350
Because your little sister's bath 
time is an event flag, isn't it?!

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:13.100
There are no events like 
that between Suzuka and me!

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:17.470
So, you said you had your 
reasons, but what's going on?

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:19.110
Oh, you're right.

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:20.760
To be honest,

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:23.110
I ran away from home!

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:25.650
I see, ran away from home...

00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:26.840
Wait, ran away from home?!

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:29.030
I had a fight with my family.

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:29.620
Huh?

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:32.540
So I don't want to be at home for a while

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:36.510
I wanted you to hear me out, 
so I wound up coming here.

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:41.190
I don't mind offering advice, 
but running away from home?

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.830
I don't want to see their faces for a while.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:47.140
This time I'm really mad at them.

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:50.900
Is there any chance of making up with them?

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:51.640
None.

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:58.070
So, I was hoping I could stay here,
 if you wouldn't mind.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:00.530
I see, with me...

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:02.650
Wait, did you just say stay here?

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:04.300
Yes, I did.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:07.530
No, no, no, there's no way you can do that!

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:08.660
Why not?

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:12.840
What do you mean why not? 
I'm a man and you're a woman!

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:15.410
What would you do 
if I did something inappropriate?

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:18.170
You'd do something inappropriate for me?!

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:19.680
What? For you?!

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:20.820
I'm kidding.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:23.140
You're not the type of person 
to do something like that,

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:25.180
and besides, even if that were to happen,

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:26.640
that'd be...

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:28.550
Po...

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:31.710
That's the first time I've 
heard someone say "po" out loud!

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:34.530
Just for one night, got it?

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:35.800
Huh?!

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:38.690
Shouldn't you be saying "Yes!" not "Huh?!"

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:40.810
I'm kidding.

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:42.350
Thank you very much.

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:44.690
You really are a nice person, Sensei.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.350
<i>Ah, I decided this all on my own,</i>

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:51.520
<i>but how am I going to explain this to Suzuka?</i>

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:55.330
Onii-chan, I called the police.

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:58.330
Past tense, not present?!

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.480
<i>Calm down!</i>

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:03.530
Onii-chan?

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:07.340
I heard talking in there.

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:09.900
Ah, Suzuka-chan, right?

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:12.070
I need to say hello to Suzuka-chan, too!

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:14.810
It'll be bad if Suzuka catches 
you here, so please keep quiet!

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:17.380
What's the matter, Onii-chan?

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:19.690
No, it's nothing!

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.810
The talking you heard was just, you know,

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:25.560
when I'm writing light novels, 
I become the character,

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:28.280
so I was reading lines out 
loud without realizing it!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.040
Oh, is that all?

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:33.280
But I thought I heard a woman's voice.

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:35.400
That was me too!

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:39.680
When I'm the heroine, it's normal 
to change my voice like this.

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:42.090
That's creepy, so could you stop?

00:06:42.090 --> 00:06:42.790
Yes.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:45.500
If that's the case, then all right.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:48.380
We have plans to go to the 
editor's tomorrow morning,

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.730
so please don't stay up too late.

00:06:50.730 --> 00:06:52.570
Yeah, I won't.

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:54.740
Good night, then, Onii-chan.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.390
We managed to avoid getting caught.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.510
Onii-chan held me from behind!

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:04.400
What are you saying?!

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:07.820
Himuro Mai

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:07.430
What is it this time?

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:08.900
Pardon me while I take this call.

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:10.730
Yes, hello?

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:13.860
Oh, what are you doing right now?

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:16.620
<i>H-Huh? I'm not doing anything.</i>

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.280
I-I thought so!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:22.000
I wouldn't mind spending some time with you.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.820
You're calling me to say that?!

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:27.000
Keep the phone call as short as possible.

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:30.410
I-I thought I just heard a woman?!

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:32.810
<i>Wh-What are you talking about?</i>

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:34.210
<i>You're just imagining it!</i>

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:37.010
Don't tell me you're with 
somebody at this time of night?!

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:39.760
I'm alone in my room right now!

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:42.520
Huh? Onii-chan, you're with me, Sakura!

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:46.390
Sakura? You're with that woman right now?!

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:47.920
<i>No! No, no, no!</i>

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:49.540
<i>That was from my eroge!</i>

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:53.200
<i>I'm playing eroge, so I 
shouldn't stay on the phone!</i>

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.530
Huh? Wait, Yuu, hey, hold on!

00:07:56.930 --> 00:07:59.860
I don't voice any eroge, you know.

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:01.250
Right?

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:03.620
Sakura.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:09.380
I'm your little sister, 
so you need to call me Sakura.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.000
Listen, Sakura-san...

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:13.220
No, it's weird to use san 
with your little sister.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:15.680
Fine, all right, Sakura!

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:18.140
Yes!

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:22.640
Another phone call?

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.150
<i>Hello?</i>

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:26.400
Sensei?

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:28.160
Good evening!

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:29.780
<i>Double Peace-sensei?!</i>

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.950
Sorry if I caught you jerking off.

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:34.020
<i>I wasn't!</i>

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:35.910
That's good to hear.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:39.190
I just sent you a really good illustration,

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:42.160
so use that as your fap material tonight!

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.670
Hey, Onii-chan, who is it this time?

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:48.100
Huh? I just heard a woman's voice.

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:49.520
<i>It's just your imagination!</i>

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:50.670
One I swear I've heard somewhere before.

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:52.580
It was a voice from an eroge!

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:56.240
I was planning to get off 
with eroge, so goodbye!

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.350
I'm going to bed now.

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.680
Yeah!

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.430
What was that, jeez.

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:05.140
Huh?

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:09.830
Why are you getting changed?!

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:13.840
Huh? Isn't it normal for little sisters 
to change in front of their brothers?

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:15.320
That's not normal at all!

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:18.540
I'll step out, so get changed then.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.160
Good grief.

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:24.830
It's ringing a lot today.

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:27.000
<i>Hello?</i>

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:29.250
Towano-sensei?

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.840
It's your favorite pupil, Kanzaki Akino.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.020
<i>When did you become my favorite pupil?!</i>

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:37.020
I want to hear your opinion on my title.

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:39.510
<i>You're completely ignoring my question...</i>

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:42.010
So what did you think?

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.790
<i>It was interesting.</i>

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:47.350
<i>It was different to read a work of
fantasy with mystery elements.</i>

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.250
You're kind, Sensei.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:52.450
I'm prepared to receive harsh 
feedback from you, as your pupil.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:55.360
You can bind me with ropes, whip me...

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:59.190
Hey! What are you planning 
to do to my little sister?!

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:00.870
<i>I didn't say anything!</i>

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:03.650
Onii-chan, I'm good now.

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:04.810
<i>Let's sleep together!</i>

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:06.300
A woman's voice?

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.540
It didn't sound like your 
little sister, though.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:09.130
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:10.170
<i>Wh-What do you mean?!</i>

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:14.000
Wh-Why you! You're with a 
woman at this hour?!

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.300
And you're sleeping together?!

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:21.370
As part of my training, 
I'm prepared to sleep with you, as well.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.410
<i>No, I want to sleep by myself!</i>

00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:29.890
She's gone?

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:35.330
Huh?

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:43.030
Onii-chan, over here, over here.

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:43.700
Huh?

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:49.760
There!

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:50.490
Shoot!

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:54.210
Onii-chan, so warm!

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:57.030
Hey! Let me go! Please!

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:03.430
<i>What am I supposed to do?!</i>

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.930
<b>My Sister, 
My Writer

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:15.780
I asked you not to stay up late, 
and you pulled an all-nighter?

00:11:16.180 --> 00:11:19.050
I was so anxious, I couldn't sleep.

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:23.330
Hey, Sensei. Sorry for making 
you come all the way out here.

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:25.580
Also, welcome, little sister.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:26.950
Th-Thank you.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:31.900
This is the Producer from the production 
company in charge of this anime, Mitarai-san,

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:34.190
and the Director, Sakurada.

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:37.170
By the way, they're also 
my juniors from college.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:42.380
I'll be the production producer 
on this project, Mitarai Daigen.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:46.220
Nice to meet you. I'll be the 
director, Sakurada Itsuki.

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:48.090
It's a pleasure to work with you.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:50.150
Nice to meet you.

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:51.330
I'm Towano Chikai.

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:52.650
It's a pleasure to work with you.

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.000
Same.

00:11:55.170 --> 00:11:59.230
I really do believe your 
title is a masterpiece.

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:01.560
Thank you so much.

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:05.990
As a fan, I'm happy to be in 
charge of its anime adaptation.

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:09.350
There are a lot of fans of 
your work at our studio, too,

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:11.530
so they're very motivated.

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:13.190
Wh-Why thank you.

00:12:13.190 --> 00:12:17.870
Onii-chan, it's rude if you 
don't introduce me, too.

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:19.000
Right.

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:22.610
This is my little sister, Suzuka.

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:25.160
She insisted on observing the meeting, 
so I brought her with me.

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:26.370
Nice to meet you.

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:28.230
I'm Nagami Suzuka.

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:32.020
My brother will be in your care, 
so please treat him well.

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:34.940
Your little sister?!

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:37.690
Sakurada-san?

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:39.080
Is something the matter?

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:41.240
Oh, no, sorry.

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:43.070
I just spaced out a bit.

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:45.970
There's something I'd 
like to ask you, Sensei.

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:48.350
Huh? Sure, what is it?

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:53.080
Sensei, what do you believe 
makes little sisters cute?

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:53.830
Huh?!

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:57.990
I wanted to have your thoughts 
reflected in this anime.

00:12:57.990 --> 00:12:59.880
Oh, right.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:03.840
I think it's the fact that they're younger, 
plus the familial relationship

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:07.850
that they share, along with the 
special moniker, "Onii-chan."

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:08.880
I see.

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:14.300
Then why were you drawn to little sisters 
out of all the archetypes out there?

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:16.900
Huh? Why, you ask?

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:19.390
I can only say I just was...

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:22.860
Have you never analyzed that "just was"?

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:25.060
Analyzed?!

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:26.860
Get a hold of yourself!

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:28.990
The little sister archetype

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:32.600
is always accompanied by the 
immorality of a blood relative,

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:35.960
as well problems with morality, 
ethics, and society's nonacceptance.

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.370
What are your thoughts on that?

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:39.040
Huh? Huh?!

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:42.620
What are your thoughts on a little 
sister scenario that ignores

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:43.980
the immorality of blood relations?

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:49.940
In mythology, incestuous marriages 
carry an aspect of "changeless,"

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:53.470
but do you have any opinions 
on such a cultural background?

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:54.510
Listen...

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:56.650
If they're a little sister, 
you should be able to

00:13:56.650 --> 00:14:00.400
love them, even if they're an 
alien, pest, or even a neutron!

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:01.880
Wha?!

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:05.190
Sakurada-san, you're troubling Sensei.

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:06.400
That's enough.

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:11.030
But, Mitarai-san, he wrote that divine title,

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:14.410
so there's no way he can't 
answer these questions.

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:20.000
Or is that as far as your little 
sister moe goes, Sensei?

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.670
Of course that's not!

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:24.020
R-Right.

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:28.760
Then, of course, you've already laid 
hands on this little sister, right?

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:29.800
Huh?!

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:33.470
You can't lay hands on 
your real little sister!

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:36.930
If you love little sisters, 
then real or not doesn't matter!

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.530
Huh?!

00:14:38.530 --> 00:14:42.180
Th-There's still a line that 
should never be crossed!

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:45.940
I can't believe those are 
the words of Towano Chikai.

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:49.230
Sakurada-san?!

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:51.740
I'm truly disappointed.

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:55.250
Sensei, you don't understand 
little sister moe.

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:57.180
Hey, what's gotten into you?

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:02.160
Senpai, thank you for arranging 
this meeting between us today.

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:04.940
Thanks to you, I've settled 
on our stance for the anime.

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:05.920
Stance?

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:08.620
For the anime adaptation,

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:12.930
I'll revise the little sister character 
using my own interpretations.

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.520
Revise?!

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:17.690
Please hold on!

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:19.990
Why are you suddenly suggesting revisions?

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:24.420
It's your fault for not understanding 
little sister moe, Sensei.

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:25.940
Now, excuse me.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.780
Hey, Sakurada!

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:30.460
I'm sorry. Wait up, Director!

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:39.960
Revisions are out of the question!

00:15:40.420 --> 00:15:42.850
The feelings I've poured 
into that character will—

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:45.450
I mean, the story will become distorted!

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:47.300
Yeah, I wholly agree!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:51.860
If you feel that way, then why 
didn't you object more back then?

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:55.700
That's because I didn't think I could 
convince Sakurada-san with an act!

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:59.670
If you can't do it with an act, then 
awaken to little sister love on the spot!

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:00.950
Don't be unreasonable!

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:06.390
Shinozaki-san gave a chance for us to 
talk to Sakurada-san once more next week,

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:11.820
so you need to stop acting and become 
a real little sister lover by then.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.410
All right! I'll start reading 
little sister titles—

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.830
When we get home, we start your 
special training, Onii-chan.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.520
Y-You'll help me?

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:24.330
Yes!

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:26.280
But we're talking about little sister moe.

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:28.090
If your brother starts 
loving little sisters...

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:33.510
I'd happily welcome—I mean, 
this is an emergency right now!

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:35.440
R-Right.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.500
Right.

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:41.520
Huh?

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:45.260
I feel like I'm forgetting 
something important.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:53.990
Welcome home, Onii-chan!

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:55.910
Wha?!

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.990
Welcome home to you, too, Suzuka-chan.

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:03.870
What's the meaning of this?!

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:06.210
It's the beginning of Hell.

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:10.670
Do you swear never to do this again?

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:14.040
I will never keep secrets 
from my little sister again.

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:17.190
Now, now, Onii-chan feels 
bad about what's he done,

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:18.960
so let him go already.

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:20.680
This is your fault, too.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:25.720
Also, don't go calling Onii-chan 
Onii-chan on your own.

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:28.650
But he is Onii-chan.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:29.650
Y-You idiot!

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:33.100
Onii-chan may be an Onii-chan, 
but Onii-chan is my Onii-chan,

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:35.650
not your Onii-chan, Minazuki-san.

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:39.620
That may be true, 
but right now he's my Onii-chan,

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:42.660
and it's only natural to call 
your Onii-chan "Onii-chan."

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:47.950
Onii-chan is only my Onii-chan, 
and no one else can call him Onii-chan.

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:50.750
So why are you in that outfit, Sakura?!

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:52.900
I found it in your room,

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:55.590
so I wore it, hoping to surprise you.

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:58.640
Onii-chan, your excuse and resolve, please.

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:02.910
Th-That was left here by Double Peace-sensei!

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:04.850
A-And what do you mean, resolve?!

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:07.110
That's enough.

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:09.480
Still, I can't believe 
you ran away from home.

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:11.800
Your family must be worried about you.

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:13.460
Don't worry.

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:17.080
I told my mother and father I 
was running away from home.

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:17.860
Huh?!

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:20.900
You ran away from home, 
but told your parents?

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:22.110
Yeah.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:25.550
I told them I'd be staying 
at a friend's house.

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:27.620
H-Hold on a minute.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:30.720
Minazuki-san, why did you run away 
from home in the first place?

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:34.110
B-Because I got in a fight 
with my brother, I suppose.

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:34.630
Huh?

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:35.900
Brother?!

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:37.980
That room was too much...

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:40.640
You have an older brother, too, Minazuki-san?

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:44.800
He's not a good brother, though.

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:50.240
My brother has no tact, he doesn't consider 
how others feel, and he's unreliable.

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:52.400
He's nothing but trouble.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:56.070
You've suffered because of your brother 
too, haven't you, Minazuki-san?

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:59.410
Suzuka, did you just say "too"?!

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:01.140
That's right.

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:05.410
He's lax when it comes to himself, 
but he always nags me.

00:19:05.900 --> 00:19:09.150
A lax brother is truly a pain.

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:10.900
You understand, too?

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:11.420
Yes!

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:14.540
It's nothing but trouble when they 
have such a loose grip on time

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:18.170
that they only barely come home in time 
for dinner without any notice or guilt.

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:24.930
He goes on forever when I'm the least bit late, 
but he can't be on time at all, you know!

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:27.050
I know, Minazuki-san!

00:19:27.050 --> 00:19:28.890
I still have even more!

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:30.940
I have even more, too!

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:37.440
Only little sisters can truly understand 
the trouble brothers cause.

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:38.950
Right?

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:42.280
So I'll stay here until the heat dies down!

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:43.690
Yes, of course.

00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:44.700
Wait, huh?

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:49.050
H-Hold on, I just misspoke.

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:51.650
Huh? Was that a lie, then?

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:53.460
Not really a lie, so much as...

00:19:54.190 --> 00:20:00.220
R-Right! I'd like to help you out, 
but we're about to get very busy.

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.180
Huh?

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:02.540
What's going on?

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:08.720
Onii-chan needs to go through special 
training to become a little sister lover.

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:17.810
Why do you need special training 
to be a little sister lover?

00:20:17.810 --> 00:20:19.980
Well, uh,

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:25.980
actually, there're some aspects of little sister 
moe that I don't really understand yet.

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:26.490
Oh?

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:28.110
Onii-chan?

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:30.130
I want you to keep this secret,

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:32.530
but I've been writing with 
those doubts in my head.

00:20:32.530 --> 00:20:36.560
"Is this really enough to satisfy 
little sister fans?" and such.

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:41.010
So I figured I need to become 
a true little sister lover.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:44.030
<i>Did I disappoint her?</i>

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:47.020
In that case, I'll be good help.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:53.270
As your little sister, I'll teach you lots 
of things that make little sisters cute!

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:55.890
What do you mean by that?!

00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:59.160
I mean, I'll help you with 
Onii-chan's special training.

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:00.010
Huh?!

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:03.280
That way Onii-chan can 
understand little sister moe,

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.700
and I can repay you letting me stay here.

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:07.280
It's two birds with one stone.

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:09.430
What are you saying?!

00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:12.200
For one thing, you're not 
his real little sister!

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:14.830
So please don't assume you're 
staying here already!

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:15.790
Huh?!

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:19.140
A-Anyway, we don't need your help.

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:24.800
Onii-chan already has me as his real 
little sister, so that's enough.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:28.550
But real little sisters and little 
sister moe are different, right?

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:29.560
Wha?!

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:31.620
I think being his real little sister would just

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:34.500
make it even harder for him to 
understand little sister moe, actually.

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:38.970
So I think I'm the one 
best suited for this job.

00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:40.680
Right, Onii-chan?

00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:42.320
Uh, well...

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:48.620
<i>Oh, no! She's about to snap, isn't she?!</i>

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:49.780
Very well.

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:54.330
Then, I'll show you.

00:21:54.930 --> 00:21:56.120
It's a match!

00:21:56.120 --> 00:22:00.340
There's no way the real little sister 
will lose to a fake little sister!

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:01.540
Huh?!

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:51.180
Illustration: Okawa Bkub

00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:37.210
Yes, hello, Esaka-san here!

00:23:37.210 --> 00:23:38.010
Today we have Reika-san!

00:23:38.010 --> 00:23:38.740
Shinozaki here.

00:23:38.740 --> 00:23:40.000
I want to grab those boobs!

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:41.620
That's a rather rough impression.

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:43.200
I've never seen a beautiful, 
big-breasted editor before.

00:23:43.200 --> 00:23:44.330
I want you to be in charge of me!

00:23:44.090 --> 00:23:49.900
Next Episode

00:23:44.090 --> 00:23:49.900
Our Special Training at the Theme Park

00:23:44.330 --> 00:23:46.930
Ahh, the desire of the person writing 
this preview is spilling out!

00:23:46.930 --> 00:23:47.750
Person writing it?

00:23:47.750 --> 00:23:49.270
See you next week!
